== Found while doing this, not fixed: a stale claim F-19 predates ==
README.md:515 says "the sole authoritative release status remains not ready". Every gate since B8 has reported state
ready (F20.gate.json: "state ready", release_ready true), because the release policy withholds unapproved stored prose
and serves only the template; what remains outstanding is content review (content_ready false). The sentence most
likely means the content-review state, but as written it is false. Not changed here: wording about release readiness
deserves the owner's eye, and test_no_document_claims_the_gate_is_green_or_the_review_complete has a docstring ("The
